          "title": "You'll want to know: സംതൃപ്തി",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സംതൃപ്തി — saṁtṛpti — \"satisfaction; contentment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ജോലി നന്നായി ചെയ്തതിൽ അവന് സംതൃപ്തി തോന്നി. jōli nannāyi ceytatil avanŭ saṁtṛpti tōnni. He felt satisfied at having done the work well."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Often with തോന്നുക or ഉണ്ട്: എനിക്ക് സംതൃപ്തി (saṁtṛpti) ഉണ്ട്, I am content."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സംതൃപ്തി (saṁtṛpti) is borrowed from Sanskrit: tṛpti, \"satisfaction, contentment\" (Monier-Williams), with the prefix saṁ-, \"fully\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
