              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗൃഹാതുരത്വം (gṛhāturatvaṁ) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit gṛha, \"a house, a home\", and ātura, \"sick in body or mind\" (Monier-Williams), with the noun ending -ത്വം."
